OL,3,GNEWSAHull MP has the Labour whip
OL,4,Arestored
OL,5,
OL,6,FKarl Turner has had the Labour whip
OL,7,Frestored on a "probationary basis".
OL,9,FThe Hull East MP was suspended from the
OL,10,Fparliamentary party in March after
OL,11,Fpublicly criticising government policy
OL,12,F` in particular the plan to restrict
OL,13,Fjury trials.
OL,15,FIn an "agreed" statement, Turner said:
OL,16,F"I want to take this opportunity to
OL,17,Fapologise and reflect on the offence I
OL,18,Fmay have caused colleagues in recent
OL,19,Fmonths."
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
