OL,3,GNEWSAHull MP has the Labour whip
OL,4,Arestored
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe added: "With the party under new
OL,7,Fleadership and a renewed approach to
OL,8,Fmanaging differences of opinion, I am
OL,9,Fkeen to move forward positively and
OL,10,Fdraw a line under this episode."
